  "summary": "Adds microbenchmarks for BIP-352 Silent Payments public key extraction (bip352::GetPubKeyFromInput) to bench_bitcoin. The suite tests standard input types—P2PKH, P2SH-P2WPKH, P2WPKH, and P2TR script-path spend—as well as a worst-case malleated P2PKH scriptSig designed to maximize hash iterations under consensus limits.",
  "problem": "Silent Payments input parsing and key extraction logic has seen bug fixes and ongoing adjustments without dedicated benchmarks to evaluate execution overhead or protect against performance regressions.",
